Third-party components
----------------------

Notarium redistributes third-party software, each under its own license; their
notices travel with the distribution:

  * Server & native runtime (Fastify, pg, the optional vector stack incl. the
    LGPL libvips shared library) — THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, in this directory and
    at /app in the image.
  * Browser bundle (React, CodeMirror, KaTeX, Mermaid, …) —
    packages/web/public/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, served at
    /licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. The first-party AGPL text travels beside
    it as /licenses/NOTARIUM-LICENSE.txt.
  * Bundled reading/code fonts (all SIL Open Font License 1.1) —
    packages/web/public/fonts/LICENSES.md and licenses/, served under /fonts/.

The third-party notices are generated by scripts/gen-licenses.mjs and
scripts/gen-reading-faces.mjs; regenerate them when a shipped dependency changes.
